{
  "title": "The Supplication of Thursday",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْم\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM. \nIn the Name of Allah, the All-beneficent, the All-merciful.\nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ الَّذِىْ اَذْهَبَ الَّيْلَ مُظْلِمًا بِقُدْرَتِهٖ \nALHAMDO LILLAAHIL LAZEE AZHARAL LAYLA MUZLEMAN BE-QUDRATEHI \nAll praise be to Allah Who has taken away the shadowy night by His power\nوَ جَآءَ بِالنَّهَارِ مُبْصِرًا بِرَحْمَتِهٖ \nWA JAAA-A BIN-NAHAARE MUBSERAN BE-RAHMATEHI \nand brought the sight-giving day through His mercy. \nوَ كَسَانِىْ ضِيَآئَهٗ وَ اَنَا فِىْ نِعْمَتِهٖ \nWA KASAANEE ZEYAAA-AHU WA ANAA FEE NEA’MATEHI \nHe has clothed me in its brightness and given me its favour. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ فَكَمَا اَبْقَيْتَنِىْ لَهٗ فَاَبْقِنِىْ لِاَمْثَالِهٖ \nALLAAHUMMA FA-KAMAA ABQAYTANEE LAHU FA ABQENEE LE-AMSAALEHEE \nO Allah, just as You have spared me for this day, so also spare me for its likes, \nوَ صَلِّ عَلَى النَّبِىِّ مُحَمَّدٍ وَ آلِهٖ \nWA SALLE A’LAN NABIYYE MOHAMMADIN WA AALEHI \nbless the Prophet Muhammad and his Household, \nوَ لَا تَفْجَعْنِىْ فِيْهِ وَ فِىْ غَيْرِهٖ مِنَ اللَّيَالِىْ وَالْاَيَّامِ\nWA LAA TAFJA’-NEE FEEHE WA FEE GHAYREHEE MENAL LAYAALEE WAL AYYAAME \ntorment me not in it and in other nights and days\n بِارْتِكَابِ الْمَحَارِمِ وَاكْتِسَابِ الْمَآثِمِ \nBIR-TEKAABIL MAHAAREME WAKTESAABIL MAAA-SEME \nby my commitment of unlawful acts and clothing myself in sins;\nوَارْزُقْنِىْ خَيْرَهٗ وَ خَيْرَ مَا فِيْهِ وَ خَيْرَ مَا بَعْدَهٗ \nWAR-ZUQNEE KHAYRAHU WA KHAYRA MAA FEEHE WA KHAYRA MAA BA’-DAHU \nprovide me with its good, the good of all within it, and the good of everything after it;\nوَاصْرِفْ عَنِّىْ شَرَّهٗ وَ شَرَّ مَا فِيْهِ وَ شَرَّ مَا بَعْدَهٗ \nWASRIF A’NNEE SHARRAHU WA SHARRA MAA FEEHE WA SHARRA MAA BA’-DAHU\nand turn away from me its evil, the evil of all within it, and the evil of everything after it!\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّىْ بِذِمَّةِ الْاِسْلَامِ اَتَوَسَّلُ اِلَيْكَ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE BE-ZIMMATIL ISLAAME ATAWASSALO ELAYKA \nO Allah, by the protective compact of Islam, I seek mediation with You!\nوَ بِحُرْمَةِ الْقُرْاٰنِ اَعْتَمِدُ عَلَيْكَ \nWA BEHURMATIL QUR-AANE A-A’TAMEDO A’LAYKA \nBy the inviolability of the Qur'an, I rely upon You!\nوَ بِمُحَمَّدِۨ الْمُصْطَفٰى صَلَّى اللهُ عَلَيْهِ وَ آلِهٖ اَسْتَشْفِعُ لَدَيْكَ \nWA BE MOHAMMADENIL MUSTAFAA SALLAL LAAHO A’LAYHE WA AALEHI ASTASHFE-O’ LADAYKA \nBy Muhammad the chosen, Allah bless him and his Household, I seek intercession with You.\nفَاعْرِفِ اللّٰهُمَّ ذِمَّتِىَ الَّتِىْ رَجَوْتُ بِهَا قَضَآءَ حَاجَتِىْ\nFA’REFIL LAAHUMMA ZIMMATEYAL LATEE RAJAWTO BEHAA QAZAAA-A HAAJATEE \nSo, recognize, O Allah! My protective compact by which I hope my need will be granted,\n يَا اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ \nYAA ARHAMAR RAAHEMEEN \nO Most Merciful of all those who show mercy!\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اقْضِ لِىْ فِىْ الْخَمِيْسِ خَمْسًا \nALLAHUMMAQ ZE LEE FIL KHAMEESE KHAMSAN \nO Allah, decree for me on Thursday five things,\nلَا يَتَّسِعُ لَهَا اِلَّا كَرَمُكَ \nLAA YATTASE-O’ LAHAA ILLAA KARAMOKA \nwhich none embraces but Your generosity\nوَ لَا يُطِيْقُهَا اِلَّا نِعَمُكَ \nWA LAA YOTEEQOHAA ILLAA NE-A’MOKA \nand none supports but Your favours:\nسَلَامَةً اَقْوٰى بِهَا عَلٰى طَاعَتِكَ \nSALAAMATAN AQWAA BEHAA A’LAA TAA-A’TEKA \nhealth through which I may have the strength to obey You,\nوَ عِبَادَةً اَسْتَحِقُّ بِهَا جَزِيْلَ مَثُوْبَتِكَ \nWA E’BAADATAN ASTAHIQQO BEHA JAZEELA MASOOBATEKA \nworship by which I may deserve Your plentiful reward,\nوَسَعَةً فِى الْحَالِ مِنَ الرِّزْقِ الْحَلَالِ \nWA SA-A’TAN FIL HAALE MENAR RIZQIL HALAALE \nplenty in my state through lawful provision,\nوَ اَنْ تُؤْمِنَنِىْ فِىْ مَوَقِفِ الْخَوْفِ بِاَمْنِكَ \nWA AN TO-MENANEE FEE MAWAQEFIL KHAWFE BE-AMNEKA \nand that You make me secure in the places of fear through Your security,\nوَ تَجْعَلَنِىْ مِنْ طَواَرِقِ الْهُمُوْمِ وَالْغُمُوْمِ فِىْ حِصْنِكَ \nWA TAJ-A’LANEE MIN TAWAAREQIL HOMOOME WAL GHOMOOME FEE HISNEKA \nand place me in Your fortress against the striking of worries and sorrows!\nوَ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ آلِ مُحَمَّدٍ \nWA SALLE ALAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMADINW\nAnd bless Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَّاجْعَلْ تَوَسُّلِىْ بِهٖ شَافِعًا يَوْمَ الْقِيَامَةِ نَافِعًا \nWAJ-A’L TAWASSOLEE BEHEE SHAAFE-A’N YAWMAL QEYAAMATE NAAFE-A’N \nand make my seeking his mediation as an intercessor give profit on the Day of Resurrection!\nاِنَّكَ اَنْتَ اَرْحَمُ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ.\nINNAKA ANTA ARHAMUR RAAHEMEEN.\nSurely, You are the Most Merciful of all those who show mercy!"
}
